      "ja": "アンモニア；シアン；それらの化合物（｛金属水素化物，モノボラン，ジボランまたはその付加錯体Ｃ０１Ｂ６／００｝；ハロゲンのオキシ酸塩Ｃ０１Ｂ１１／００；過酸化物，ペルオキシ酸塩Ｃ０１Ｂ１５／００；チオ硫酸塩，亜ニチオン酸塩，多チオン酸塩Ｃ０１Ｂ１７／６４；セレンまたはテルルを含む化合物Ｃ０１Ｂ１９／００；アジドＣ０１Ｂ２１／０８；｛窒素，非金属，必要により金属を含有する，アンモニア，シアン以外の化合物Ｃ０１Ｂ２１／０８２｝；金属イミドまたはアミドＣ０１Ｂ２１／０９２；亜硝酸塩Ｃ０１Ｂ２１／５０；[Ｎ:希ガスの化合物Ｃ０１Ｂ２３／０００５]；りん化物Ｃ０１Ｂ２５／０８；りんのオキシ酸塩Ｃ０１Ｂ２５／１６；けい素を含む化合物Ｃ０１Ｂ３３／００；ほう素を含む化合物Ｃ０１Ｂ３５／００）",
      "en": "AMMONIA; CYANOGEN; COMPOUNDS THEREOF ({metal hydrides, monoborane, diborane or addition complexes thereof C01B6/00}; salts of oxyacids of halogens C01B11/00; peroxides, salts of peroxyacids C01B15/00; thiosulfates, dithionites, polythionates C01B17/64; compounds containing selenium or tellurium C01B19/00; azides C01B21/08; {compounds other than ammonia or cyanogen, containing nitrogen, non-metals and optionally metals C01B21/082}; metal imides or amides C01B21/092; nitrites C01B21/50; {compounds of noble gases C01B23/0005}; phosphides C01B25/08; salts of oxyacids of phosphorus C01B25/16; compounds containing silicon C01B33/00; compounds containing boron C01B35/00)<br><br><u>WARNING</u><br><br>In this subclass non-limiting references (in the sense of paragraph 39 of the Guide to the IPC) may still be displayed in the scheme.",
